### 🔹 Feature 13: In-App Voice Call

**Description:** Internet দিয়ে free call করা যাবে। Phone number share হবে না (privacy)।

**Workflow:**
1. Rider taps 📞 Call → Call screen opens
2. Socket.io sends "offer" → Driver receives → Sends "answer"
