### 🔹 Feature 15: Card Payment (Stripe)

**Description:** International card add করে secure one-tap payment করতে পারবে।

**Workflow:**
1. **First time:** User adds card → Stripe tokenizes (never stores actual number) → Saves token
2. Shows: "Visa ending in 4242"
3. At ride end → "Pay ৳340 with Visa •••• 4242" → Tap "Pay Now"
4. Backend calls Stripe API → Charge card
5. ✅ Success → Payment complete, receipt generated
6. ❌ Fail → Error message, fallback to cash option

**Security:** PCI DSS compliant · Stripe handles all card data · Encrypted transmission · 3D Secure support

**Tech Stack:** Stripe SDK · PostgreSQL (`payment_methods` table) · BDT → USD auto-conversion

