### 🔹 Feature 21: Ride Request Notification

**Description:** Nearby ride request পেলে push notification, 30-second timer সহ।

**Workflow:**
1. System finds driver via `GEORADIUS` (within radius, online, vehicle matches)
2. FCM push + in-app WebSocket notification
3. Shows: Pickup, drop, fare, distance to pickup, 30-second countdown timer
4. **Loud sound + strong vibration** (driver may be driving)
5. If no response in 30s → Auto-decline → Next driver
6. Multiple requests possible → First-come-first-serve

**Notification Content:** Title, pickup/drop addresses, estimated fare, distance to pickup, ETA to pickup

**Tech Stack:** FCM (high priority, heads-up display) · Socket.io (in-app) · Custom notification sound

