### 🔹 Feature 26: Navigation During Ride

**Description:** Google Maps follow করে destination এ যাওয়া। Route GPS points store হবে database এ।

**Simultaneously happening:**
1. Driver follows turn-by-turn navigation
2. GPS records every 5 seconds: `{ ride_id, lat, lng, speed, heading, timestamp }`
3. Rider sees live tracking on map
4. Route stored for: fare calculation, dispute resolution, analytics, legal proof

**Storage:** 1 ride ≈ 200-300 GPS points ≈ 4KB · 10,000 rides/month ≈ 40MB (manageable)

---

### 🔹 Feature 27: End Ride

**Description:** Destination এ driver "End Ride" tap করবে, actual distance/time calculate হবে, final fare compute হবে।

**Workflow:**
1. Driver reaches destination → Taps "End Ride"
2. System calculates **actual distance** from GPS points (Haversine formula)
3. Calculates **actual time** (`completed_at - started_at`)
4. Final fare = Base + (actual_distance × rate) + (actual_time × rate) × **surge from booking time**
5. Round to nearest ৳5
6. Both see: final fare, distance, time
7. Triggers payment flow (Feature 14/15)

