5. Confirms delivery → Status: `delivered`
6. Sender gets SMS: "Your parcel has been delivered successfully"
7. Everyone sees completion screen with receipt

**Tech Stack:** Same as pickup + Digital signature capture · Multi-party notifications (SMS + email)

