## 📦 CATEGORY 3: PARCEL DELIVERY FEATURES (2 Features)

---

### 🔹 Feature 35: Parcel Booking

**Description:** Customer parcel send করার জন্য step-by-step booking করবে।

**Multi-step Form:**
1. **Sender Details:** Name, phone, pickup address (auto-filled from profile)
2. **Receiver Details:** Name, phone, **email** (required for tracking link), delivery address
3. **Parcel Details:** Type (Documents/Food/Electronics/Clothing/Other), weight (kg), declared value (৳), fragile flag, special instructions, optional photo
4. **Payment Mode:**
   - Mode 1: **Receiver pays delivery fee** (90% of cases — online shopping)
   - Mode 2: **Full COD** — Driver collects item price + delivery fee
   - Mode 3: **Sender pays now** — Free delivery for receiver (gifting)

**Delivery Fee Formula:** Base fare (৳60) + (Distance × ৳15/km) + Weight surcharge + Fragile fee (৳20)

**After booking:**
- Generates 2 separate OTPs: **Pickup code** (to sender) + **Delivery code** (to receiver)
- Generates **public tracking link** (UUID token)
- Sends email to receiver with tracking link + delivery code
- Sends SMS to sender with pickup code
- Starts finding nearby drivers

**Tech Stack:** Multi-step form wizard · PostgreSQL (`parcels` table) · SendGrid / AWS SES (email) · Twilio (SMS) · UUID tracking token

---

### 🔹 Feature 36: Parcel Tracking (Public)

**Description:** Receiver browser এ tracking link open করে live driver location দেখতে পারবে — **No app needed, no login needed!**

**URL:** `https://rideshare.com/track/{tracking_token}`

**What receiver sees:**
1. **Status timeline:** Booked → Driver Assigned → Picked Up → In Transit → Delivered
2. **Driver info:** Name, photo, rating, masked phone
3. **Live map** with moving driver icon + route line + ETA
4. **Delivery code** reminder
5. Updates automatically (no refresh needed) via Firebase

**Privacy protections:** Sender name partial · Driver phone masked · Read-only · No sensitive data · Link expires **1 hour after delivery**

**Tech Stack:** HTML/CSS/JS or Next.js static page · Google Maps JS API · Firebase Realtime Database · Public API endpoint (no auth, UUID validation)

---

## 🛠️ CATEGORY 4: ADMIN FEATURES (10 Features)

---

### 🔹 Feature 37: Driver Document Verification

**Description:** Admin pending drivers list দেখবে, documents manually check করবে, approve/reject করবে reason সহ।

**Admin Panel shows:**
- Pending verifications list (sortable, searchable)
- Document viewer with **zoom & download**
- Verification checklist (NID clear? License valid? Photo matches? Vehicle condition?)

**Actions:**
- ✅ **Approve:** Status → `active`, driver can go online, push + email + SMS notification
- ❌ **Reject:** Must provide reason (dropdown + text), specify which documents to resubmit, notification sent

**Audit trail:** `verification_logs` table — who verified, when, action, reason

**Tech Stack:** React.js admin panel · Lightbox/zoom viewer · RBAC (role-based access) · FCM + Email + SMS (notifications) · PostgreSQL (audit logs)

---

### 🔹 Feature 38: Admin Dashboard

**Description:** Web panel এ total rides, revenue, active users, charts, live map দেখা একসাথে।

**Dashboard Widgets:**
- **KPI Cards:** Rides today (234), Revenue (৳58,450), Users (892), Drivers online (32)
- **Live Metrics:** Active rides, waiting riders, available drivers, avg wait time
- **Charts:** Rides over 7 days (line), Revenue breakdown (pie), Hourly distribution (bar)
- **Live Map:** Active rides (🔵), available drivers (🟢), waiting riders (🔴)
- **Pending Actions:** Driver verifications, dispute reports, overdue settlements
- **Activity Feed:** Real-time log of recent events

**Updates:** WebSocket → Stats refresh every 30s · Map every 5s · Activity feed real-time

**Tech Stack:** React.js · Chart.js / Recharts · Google Maps JS API · Socket.io (WebSocket) · Redis (cache, 30s TTL) · SQL aggregation queries

---

### 🔹 Feature 39: Ride Monitoring

**Description:** All rides filter করে দেখা, specific ride details + live tracking করা, emergency cancel করা।

**Filters:** Status · Date range · Driver/Rider · Payment method · Search by ride ID, phone, location

**Ride Details View:** Full info — rider/driver details, route map with GPS trail, fare breakdown, payment info, complete timeline, ratings & feedback

**Admin Actions:** Live tracking (active rides) · Emergency cancel (with reason + refund options) · Contact rider/driver · Issue refund · Add admin notes · Bulk export (CSV/Excel)

**Tech Stack:** React data table · Complex SQL with JOINs · WebSocket (active rides) · Google Maps (route replay) · Full-text search (PostgreSQL)

---

### 🔹 Feature 40: User Management

**Description:** All users search করে details দেখা, block/unblock করা, history access করা।

**User List:** Search by name/phone/ID · Filter by role/status · Sort by join date, rating, rides

**User Details:** Profile info · Ride history · Payment history · Ratings · Documents (if driver) · Activity logs

**Actions:** Block/unblock (with reason) · View histories · Add admin notes · Send notification

**Blocking Reasons:** Multiple complaints · Consistently low rating · Fraudulent activity · Inappropriate behavior · Payment issues

**Tech Stack:** CRUD on `users` table · `users.status = 'blocked'` → Can't book/accept rides

---

### 🔹 Feature 41: Financial Reports

**Description:** Daily/weekly/monthly revenue reports দেখবে, commission breakdown, driver payouts list, Excel export করবে।

**Report Types:** Daily/weekly/monthly revenue · Driver payouts (pending + paid) · Payment method breakdown · Commission earned · Refunds · Top earners · Revenue by vehicle type

**Data:** Total rides · Total fare · Platform commission (25%) · Driver earnings (75%) · Cash vs digital · Avg fare · Revenue growth

**Export:** Excel (.xlsx) · CSV · PDF · Email report · Scheduled automated reports

**Tech Stack:** SQL aggregation queries · `xlsx` / `csv-writer` library · Cron jobs (scheduled reports)

---

### 🔹 Feature 42: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

**Description:** Different admin roles create করা specific permissions সহ।

**Roles:**
| Role | Permissions |
|---|---|
| **Super Admin** | All permissions, create/delete admins, full access |
| **Verifier** | Verify drivers, view documents only |
| **Support** | User management, ride monitoring, dispute handling |
| **Finance** | Financial reports, payouts, settlements |
| **Operations** | Ride monitoring, system health |

**Tech Stack:** PostgreSQL (`admin_users` table with `role` and `permissions` JSON) · Middleware (permission checks)

---

### 🔹 Feature 43: Fleet Management Approval

**Description:** Fleet owners verify করা, fleet details review করা, approve/reject করা।

Admin verifies fleet owner's company registration, trade license, vehicle ownership proof. Approves fleet → Owner can add multiple drivers under fleet.

---

### 🔹 Feature 44: Ride Bidding Configuration

**Description:** নির্দিষ্ট শহরের জন্য bidding module enable/disable করা, rules set করা।

Admin can enable a rider-driver bidding system per city, set min/max bid ranges, and configure bidding rules.

---

### 🔹 Feature 45: System Monitoring

**Description:** Server health, API performance, error logs monitor করা real-time।

Monitors: Server uptime, API response times, error rates, database performance, active connections.

