## 💳 CATEGORY 6: PAYMENT GATEWAY (1 Feature)

---

### 🔹 Feature 46: bKash Payment Integration

**Description:** বিকাশ tokenized checkout API integration করে secure mobile payment enable করা। (Bangladesh-specific)

**Workflow:**
1. **First time:** Opens bKash authorization page → Enters bKash number + PIN → Authorizes app → System saves agreement token
2. **Subsequent times:** Ride ends → Confirms payment → Charges via saved token (PIN only) → Payment completes in **10 seconds**

**Fee:** 1.85% charged by bKash per transaction

**Prerequisites:** Trade license · bKash merchant account

**Tech Stack:** bKash Tokenized Checkout API · PostgreSQL (`bkash_tokens` table: user_id, agreement_id, masked account, expiry)

---

## 🔔 CATEGORY 7: NOTIFICATIONS (1 Feature)

---

### 🔹 Feature 47: FCM Push Notifications

**Description:** All events এ Firebase Cloud Messaging দিয়ে real-time push notifications পাঠানো।

**Notification Types:**

| For Riders | For Drivers |
|---|---|
| Driver accepted your ride | New ride request |
| Driver arriving in 2 minutes | Rider cancelled |
| Driver has arrived | Payment received |
| Ride has started | Daily earnings summary |
| Ride completed | Weekly payout processed |
| Payment successful | Document verification decision |
| New promo code available | — |

**Features:** Push to phone even if app closed · Sound + vibration · Tap to open relevant screen · Notification history · Settings to enable/disable types

**Tech Stack:** Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) · PostgreSQL (`fcm_tokens` table) · Node.js backend (trigger service)

